</section></score></mdiv></body>
<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Lord, turn our gaze upon Thy Cross,</l><l>Counting all else not gain but loss;</l><l>For this we pray, this is our plea—</l><l>Lord, keep our eyes on Calvary.</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
</music></mei>
